WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.840 line:84%
Hello! In this lesson we will learn the Hindi script, Devanagari, and its vowels.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:12.651 line:84%
The first six vowels are: a, aa, i, ee, u, oo. Say each one carefully.

00:00:13.651 --> 00:00:17.051 line:84%
Now the remaining vowels: e, ai, o, au.

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:23.811 line:84%
Now say all the vowels once more. Repeat each letter three times.
